{"nodes": [{"id": "public_greydigi_logo_brand_mark", "label": "GreyDigi Brand Logo Mark", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "public/greydigi-logo.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "public_greydigi_logo_split_brain_motif", "label": "Split-Brain Motif (Organic Left / Circuit Right)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "public/greydigi-logo.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "public_greydigi_logo_organic_hemisphere", "label": "Solid Coral Organic Hemisphere with Neural Traces", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "public/greydigi-logo.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "public_greydigi_logo_circuit_hemisphere", "label": "Circuit-Board Hemisphere with PCB Traces and Via Nodes", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "public/greydigi-logo.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "public_greydigi_logo_coral_grey_gradient", "label": "Coral-to-Grey Gradient Palette", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "public/greydigi-logo.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "public_greydigi_logo_human_ai_fusion", "label": "Human Intelligence Meets Digital Technology", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "public/greydigi-logo.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The mark splits a brain down the midline: the left half is a solid coral organic cerebrum with white cutout traces ending in rounded terminal dots (dendrites/neurons), the right half is the same silhouette redrawn as printed-circuit routing with right-angle bends and ring-shaped vias fading from coral to grey. The rationale is that the two halves are the SAME shape drawn in two vocabularies, asserting that biological cognition and digital computation are one continuous system rather than opposed ones. The coral-to-grey fade encodes the company name itself (Grey + Digi) and lets the grey terminals recede so the coral side reads as the focal, warm, human element while the technology side reads as neutral infrastructure."}, {"id": "public_greydigi_logo_negative_space_symmetry", "label": "Negative-Space Trace Symmetry Between Halves", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "public/greydigi-logo.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Traces are knocked out of the coral fill as white negative space on the left, but drawn as positive coral/grey strokes on a transparent ground on the right. This inversion keeps a single visual weight across the mark while letting it sit on any background, and makes the logo legible at favicon size because the silhouette survives even when the interior detail collapses."}, {"id": "public_greydigi_logo_web_asset", "label": "Public Static Brand Asset (public/greydigi-logo.png)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "public/greydigi-logo.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Placed in the Next.js public/ directory, so it is served verbatim at the /greydigi-logo.png route and is referenced by path string rather than by import. Because the reference is a string literal, no AST edge exists between consuming components and this asset."}], "edges": [{"source": "public_greydigi_logo_brand_mark", "target": "public_greydigi_logo_split_brain_motif", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "public/greydigi-logo.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "public_greydigi_logo_split_brain_motif", "target": "public_greydigi_logo_organic_hemisphere", "relati